cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software or the underlying NASA-IBM Lunar Foundation Model representations in your research, please cite both this repository and the foundational publications below."
title: "lunar-lfm-explorer: FAIR Exploration Toolkit for the NASA-IBM Lunar Foundation Model"
abstract: "A FAIR-compliant scientific toolkit and interactive explorer for the NASA-IBM Lunar Foundation Model (ViT-B multimodal remote sensing encoder-decoder trained on SomBench's 2 million lunar tile bundles across 11 modalities and 2 scale families)."
type: software
license: Apache-2.0
repository-code: "https://github.com/dr-richard-barker/Lunar_analysis"
keywords:
  - "lunar remote sensing"
  - "foundation model"
  - "multimodal"
  - "vision transformer"
  - "planetary science"
  - "LROC"
  - "SomBench"
  - "NASA IBM AI for Science"
  - "FAIR software"

